  "title": "Kirby Problem 3.4",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "(Chen--Yang Volume Conjecture). (a) Prove that, for any hyperbolic 3-manifold $M$,\n\n$$\n\\lim_{\\substack{r\\to\\infty\\\\ r\\ \\mathrm{odd}}}\\frac{1}{r}\\log\\bigl(TV(M;e^{2\\pi i/r})\\bigr)\n=\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\operatorname{Vol}(M).\n$$\n\n(b) Prove that, for any closed, oriented, hyperbolic 3-manifold $M$,\n\n$$\n\\lim_{\\substack{r\\to\\infty\\\\ r\\ \\mathrm{odd}}}\\frac{1}{r}\\log\\bigl(WRT(M;e^{2\\pi i/r})\\bigr)\n=\\frac{1}{4\\pi}\\bigl(\\operatorname{Vol}(M)-i\\operatorname{CS}(M)\\bigr).\n$$",
